{"id":"d2cf6bb66fd8df63","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-bounded-variation-approximation.md","title":"Computable Rational Approximation of Bounded Variation","display":"df-bounded-variation-approximation — Computable Rational Approximation of Bounded Variation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-bounded-variation-approximation","aliases":["43-df-bounded-variation-approximation"],"display":"df-bounded-variation-approximation — Computable Rational Approximation of Bounded Variation","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Lemma 8.5.2, displayed variation condition","source_printed_pages":"152","source_pdf_pages":"172","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-bounded-variation-approximation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-bounded-variation-approximation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-variation-approximation — Computable Rational Approximation of Bounded Variation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 8.5.2, displayed variation condition"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"152"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"172"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\">\\(q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\)</span>；有理数使用本书固定有效编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(q)\">\\(V(q)\\)</span> 取值于扩充非负实数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,\\infty]\">\\([0,\\infty]\\)</span>；本节引入谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BVApprox}(q,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{BVApprox}(q,x)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V(q)\\coloneqq\\sup_{N\\in\\mathbb N}\\sum_{s&lt;N}|q(s+1)-q(s)|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V(q)\\coloneqq\\sup_{N\\in\\mathbb N}\\sum_{s&lt;N}|q(s+1)-q(s)|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BVApprox}(q,x)\\iff\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(q)\\land\\left(\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow|q(s)-x|\\le2^{-k})\\right)\\land V(q)&lt;\\infty.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BVApprox}(q,x)\\iff\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(q)\\land\\left(\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow|q(s)-x|\\le2^{-k})\\right)\\land V(q)&lt;\\infty.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>允许有限总变差没有可计算的已知上界，也不要求有效收敛模。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=0\">\\(N=0\\)</span> 时空和为零；上确界作为扩充实数始终存在。此节点将原书引理中的条件显式抽成可复用定义。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Lemma 8.5.2, displayed variation condition；印刷页 152，PDF 页 172。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathbb R$，$q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q$；有理数使用本书固定有效编码，$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 采用 [[43-df-computable]]。$V(q)$ 取值于扩充非负实数 $[0,\\infty]$；本节引入谓词 $\\operatorname{BVApprox}(q,x)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"V(q)","display":false},{"tex":"[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BVApprox}(q,x)","display":false},{"tex":"V(q)\\coloneqq\\sup_{N\\in\\mathbb N}\\sum_{s<N}|q(s+1)-q(s)|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BVApprox}(q,x)\\iff\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(q)\\land\\left(\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow|q(s)-x|\\le2^{-k})\\right)\\land V(q)<\\infty.","display":true},{"tex":"N=0","display":false}],"bytes":1765,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-bounded-variation-approximation]] — Computable Rational Approximation of Bounded Variation"},{"id":"87a029d02ac0983e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]，$\\operatorname{BVApprox}$ 采用 [[43-df-bounded-variation-approximation]]。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a"]}